{
  "notes": ["HP = EnemySpawner.enemy_base_health (current, grows with time) * health_mult; contact damage = enemy_base_damage (current) * damage_mult (res://Scripts/Battle/EnemySpawner.gd:140-142). Base values per prestige are in prestige.json.", "Actual move speed = move_speed * prestige enemy_speed_mod (res://Scripts/Battle/EnemySpawner.gd:142).", "Sprites are 128 px art scaled by \"scale\"; on-screen width = 128 * scale (res://Scripts/Enemy/Enemy.gd:59-60). Hitbox = hitbox_unscaled * scale.", "Colour = currency colour: red Bits (f03a3f), blue Nodes (457af6), yellow Processors (eed345), purple boss/Cores (c359fb) (res://Scripts/Enums/ResourceType.gd:33-40).", "Spawn: off-screen on a random side, offset 0.7*width, heading towards a random point within 84 px of the screen centre (res://Scripts/Battle/EnemySpawner.gd:177-205). Despawn when off-screen after 5 s alive (res://Scripts/Enemy/Enemy.gd:118-123).", "Pill: wavy movement, amplitude 34, period 1.0 (sin(t * 1.0)), faces its velocity (res://Scripts/Enemy/Enemy.gd:22-24,105-113).", "Pentagon splits into 6 PentagonSmall within 40 px on death, same currency, same direction (res://Scripts/Battle/EnemySpawner.gd:246-249,265-269).", "Exploder (circle) explodes on death: 110 px * (1 + exploder_size) square box, random angle 0-90 deg, hitting other enemies with the player attack damage (res://Scripts/Battle/EnemySpawner.gd:243-245).", "Yellow (processor) enemies use the same weights minus BigSquare and Pentagon (res://Scripts/Battle/EnemySpawner.gd:44-48)."],
